				<description>Status: Operational
Crude grade: Murban | API: ~40.3° | Sulfur: ~0.78% (light sour)
Benchmark: ICE Murban Futures (IFAD), physically delivered FOB Fujairah — launched 2021 as a rival to Brent and Dubai for Asian buyers
Operator: ADNOC Onshore
Role: One of the four Murban-contributing onshore fields, developed as part of the Sahil-Asab-Shah cluster in Abu Dhabi&apos;s interior
Export route: Habshan gathering, then Jebel Dhanna or ADCOP to Fujairah
