				<description>Status: Operational
Crude grade: Iranian Light | API: 33.6° | Sulfur: 1.46% (medium sour)
Benchmark: NIOC monthly OSP against Oman/Dubai for Asia, Dated Brent for Europe; Iran Light is the country&apos;s flagship grade
Operator: National Iranian South Oil Company (NISOC)
Role: A giant Khuzestan field discovered in 1936 and one of the historic pillars of Iranian Light
