Benchmark: NIOC publishes a separate monthly OSP for Forozan alongside Iranian Light and Heavy, for Asia, north-west Europe and the Mediterranean
Operator: Iranian Offshore Oil Company
Role: An offshore Persian Gulf field near Kharg, shared geologically with Saudi Arabia&apos;s Marjan structure, and the anchor of the Forozan Blend export grade
