				<description>Status: Operational
Crude grade: Lavan Blend | API: 35.2° | Sulfur: moderate (light sour)
Benchmark: Priced against Dated Brent and the Oman/Dubai complex; a small, separately marketed grade
Operator: Iranian Offshore Oil Company
Role: The largest of the offshore fields around Lavan Island in the southern Persian Gulf, with Reshadat and Resalat alongside it — their output forms Lavan Blend, the lightest of Iran&apos;s crude export grades
