				<description>Status: Operational
Crude grade: Mars | API: ~29.5° | Sulfur: ~1.89% (medium sour)
Benchmark: Sold within the Mars stream against WTI Cushing
Operator: Shell
Role: One of the newer Mississippi Canyon developments feeding the Mars stream, built to a simplified, lower-cost design after the 2014 price crash
Export route: Into the Mars system and on to LOOP Clovelly
Risks: Hurricane exposure; shares the Mars stream&apos;s market position</description>
