Crude grade: Thunder Horse | medium sour
Benchmark: Sold within the Thunder Horse stream against WTI Cushing
Operator: Shell
Role: A 175,000 boe/d Norphlet-play development whose crude is marketed as Thunder Horse rather than Mars — an example of a producer&apos;s barrels being sold under a competitor&apos;s stream name because of which pipeline they enter
Export route: Proteus and Endymion offshore pipelines to LOOP Clovelly
