Benchmark: Priced as a differential to WTI Cushing; with Mars it makes up LOOP Sour, and Platts assesses LOOP Sour around 20 cents/b below Poseidon
Operator: Multiple deepwater producers shipping on the Poseidon Oil Pipeline
Role: The central Gulf deepwater fields feeding the 300,000 b/d Poseidon pipeline, a segregated stream since 1997 when it stopped commingling with Eugene Island
Export route: Poseidon pipeline to Louisiana
Risks: Hurricane exposure; the heaviest and sourest Gulf stream, so the most discount-sensitive</description>
