Benchmark: Priced as a differential to WTI Cushing; lighter and sweeter than Mars, so it usually trades at a smaller discount
Operator: Multiple central Gulf shelf and deepwater producers
Role: The central Gulf fields feeding the 184-mile Eugene Island Pipeline System, which moves about 200,000 b/d ashore to Louisiana terminals including Caillou Island
