				<description>Status: Operational
Crude grade: Oriente | API: ~24-25° | Sulfur: ~1.0-1.5% (medium sour)
Benchmark: Oriente is Ecuador&apos;s medium sour export grade, priced against WTI and Dated Brent; buyers are chiefly US West Coast, Gulf Coast and Asian refiners
Operator: Petroecuador
Role: One of Ecuador&apos;s largest fields alongside Shushufindi, in the Oriente Basin, and a core contributor to the Oriente blend
