				<description>Status: Operational
Crude grade: Napo | API: ~18.8-19.2° | Sulfur: ~2.0-2.1% (heavy sour)
Benchmark: Napo is the heavy sour grade, priced against WTI; comparable in gravity to Mexican Maya and aimed at US Gulf Coast refiners configured for heavy sour feed
Operator: Petroecuador, previously developed under private operatorship
