				<name>Liza Unity FPSO (Unity Gold)</name>
				<description>Status: Operational — first oil February 2022
Crude grade: Unity Gold | API: 34.5° | Sulfur: 0.41% (medium sweet)
Benchmark: Assessed by Platts and Argus against the Latin America Dated Brent strip, ICE Brent and WTI, on FOB cargoes of 1 million barrels
Operator: ExxonMobil Guyana 45%, Chevron 35% (acquired from Hess), CNOOC 20%
Role: The second Stabroek Block development, producing from the Liza Unity FPSO — a lighter, sweeter stream than Liza, sold as its own grade rather than blended with it
Export route: Direct tanker loading from the FPSO
