				<description>Status: Operational — first oil November 2023, ahead of schedule
Crude grade: Payara Gold | API: 28° | Sulfur: 0.58% (the heaviest Guyanese grade)
Benchmark: Assessed by Platts and Argus against the Latin America Dated Brent strip, ICE Brent and WTI, on FOB cargoes of 1 million barrels
Operator: ExxonMobil Guyana 45%, Chevron 35% (acquired from Hess), CNOOC 20%
