Benchmark: Sonatrach sets a monthly official price for Saharan Blend against Dated Brent — recently around a 40 cents/b PREMIUM, one of the few crudes in the region to price above the marker and the direct competitor to Libya&apos;s El Sharara
Operator: Sonatrach
