				<description>Status: Operational — subject to recurring force majeure
Crude grade: El Feel | API: light sweet
Benchmark: Priced against Dated Brent; loaded at Zawiya alongside El Sharara
Operator: Mellitah Oil &amp; Gas — a NOC and Eni joint venture
Role: A 70,000 b/d Murzuq Basin field south-west of Sharara, sharing the same export corridor north to Zawiya
Export route: Pipeline to the Zawiya terminal
