				<name>Messla Field</name>
				<description>Status: Operational
Crude grade: Mesla | API: light
Benchmark: NOC monthly official price against Dated Brent, typically alongside Sarir
Operator: Arabian Gulf Oil Company (AGOCO)
Role: An eastern Sirte Basin field adjacent to Sarir, sharing its gathering and export infrastructure
