			<Placemark>
				<name>Zubair Oil Field</name>
				<description>Status: Operational
Crude grade: Basrah Light | API: ~31.4° | Sulfur: ~2.74% (medium sour)
Benchmark: SOMO Official Selling Price, against Platts Dubai / DME Oman
Operator: Basra Oil Company with Eni as lead contractor
Role: With Rumaila, one of the two traditional southern fields producing the lighter crude at the core of Basrah Light
Export route: Pipelines to Fao, then ABOT
Risks: Hormuz dependence; regional security; field-maturity management</description>
