				<description>Status: Operational
Crude grade: Basrah Medium | API: ~27.9° | Sulfur: ~3.0% (medium/heavy sour)
Benchmark: SOMO Official Selling Price, against Platts Dubai / DME Oman
Operator: Basra Oil Company with PetroChina as lead contractor
Role: Named by SOMO as one of the heavier fields (with West Qurna 2 and Missan) whose output forced the 2021 restructuring of Iraq&apos;s export grades
