				<description>Status: Operational
Crude grade: Kuwait Export Crude (KEC) | API: ~30.2° | Sulfur: ~2.7% (medium sour)
Benchmark: KPC Official Selling Price, against Platts Dubai / DME Oman for Asia
Operator: Kuwait Oil Company (KOC)
Role: A northern Kuwait field adjacent to Raudhatain, contributing to the KEC blend
Export route: North Kuwait gathering network to Mina Al-Ahmadi
Risks: Field maturity; northern border-area location; Hormuz dependence</description>
