				<name>Zuluf Oil Field (Offshore)</name>
				<description>Status: Operational
Crude grade: Arab Medium | API: ~28-31° | Sulfur: ~2.55-2.75% (medium sour)
Benchmark: Saudi Aramco OSP, set monthly against Oman/Dubai for Asia
Operator: Saudi Aramco
Role: One of the two main offshore sources of Arab Medium, alongside Marjan
Export route: Offshore gathering to Ras Tanura/Ju&apos;aymah
Risks: Offshore production costs; Arab Medium competes with Basrah Medium, Urals and Iranian Heavy in the same Asian buyer pool; Hormuz dependence</description>
