			<Placemark>
				<name>Marjan Oil Field (Offshore)</name>
				<description>Status: Operational
Crude grade: Arab Medium | API: ~28-31° | Sulfur: ~2.55-2.75% (medium sour)
Benchmark: Saudi Aramco OSP, set monthly against Oman/Dubai for Asia
Operator: Saudi Aramco
Role: The second main offshore source of Arab Medium alongside Zuluf; subject of a major Aramco expansion programme
Export route: Offshore gathering to Ras Tanura/Ju&apos;aymah
Risks: Offshore production costs; direct competition from discounted sour grades in Asia; Hormuz dependence</description>
				<styleUrl>#default10</styleUrl>
				<Point>
					<coordinates>49.55,28.25,0</coordinates>
