Operator: BP (operator) with SOCAR, TPAO, Lukoil, NICO and Petronas
Role: Azerbaijan&apos;s giant Caspian gas field, mapped here for its liquids stream rather than its gas — Shah Deniz condensate is processed at Sangachal and exported through BTC together with ACG crude
