					<name>CEPSA La Rábida Refinery (Huelva)</name>
					<description>Status: Operational
Owner: CEPSA
Capacity: 190,000 b/d — on Spain&apos;s Atlantic (Gulf of Cádiz) coast at Huelva
Role: Directly receives crude via its own port facilities; part of CEPSA&apos;s two-refinery system alongside San Roque
Risks: Atlantic storm exposure; competes with San Roque for CEPSA&apos;s crude allocation</description>
