					<description>Status: Operational
Owner: Repsol
Capacity: 186,000 b/d — on the Mediterranean coast, Catalonia
Role: Directly receives crude via its own port facilities; supplies the Barcelona metropolitan area and north-east Spain
Risks: Mediterranean shipping-lane exposure; regional demand tied to Catalonia&apos;s industrial base</description>
