				<Placemark>
					<name>Repsol Puertollano Refinery</name>
					<description>Status: Operational
Owner: Repsol
Capacity: 150,000 b/d — Spain&apos;s ONLY landlocked refinery, in Ciudad Real, central Spain
Feedstock: Cannot receive crude directly — entirely dependent on the 357 km Cartagena-Puertollano pipeline for its crude supply
Role: Part of Repsol&apos;s &quot;operate as one&quot; strategy — Cartagena and Puertollano are managed as a single integrated system since the pipeline connection, distributing fuel sustainably across mainland Spain
Risks: Total dependence on a single pipeline; a 2025 fuel-theft attack on this exact line spilled oil across 5 km2 of woodland, causing over €4 million in damage — illustrating the vulnerability of being the one inland refinery with no alternative crude route</description>
