Owner: Repsol
Capacity: 120,000 b/d — on Spain&apos;s north-west Atlantic (Galician) coast
Role: Directly receives crude via its own port facilities; the smallest of Repsol&apos;s coastal refineries
Risks: Remote location; smallest-scale plant among Spain&apos;s major refineries</description>
