					<description>Status: Operational
Owner: Petroperu
Capacity: ~15,500 b/d — a small refinery south of Lima
Role: A secondary Lima-area supplier alongside the much larger La Pampilla, focused on asphalt and lubricants as well as fuels
Risks: Sub-scale versus La Pampilla; limited strategic weight in the national balance</description>
