					<name>Pemex Cadereyta Refinery</name>
					<description>Status: Operational
Owner: Pemex (Petroleos Mexicanos), state-owned
Capacity: 275,000 b/d — in Nuevo Leon, northern Mexico, near Monterrey; supplies the industrial north
Feedstock: Heavy Maya crude
Risks: Environmental and water-use scrutiny in an arid region; heavy-crude yield challenges</description>
