Operator: PDVSA
Capacity: ~187,000 b/d NAMEPLATE; a deep-conversion upgrade project (with Chinese contractors) was left incomplete by the crisis
Crude grades: Monagas light/medium via the Furrial line
Role &amp; connections: Eastern domestic supply plus the terminal complex next door
Source: EIA nameplate; industry reporting</description>
