Recent: Running at reduced capacity after an October 2025 fire on the AV3 crude unit; full capacity expected Q3 2026
Strategic role: Hungary&apos;s principal refinery and the country&apos;s fuel-supply hub
Risks: Druzhba disruption; Russian-crude dependence; Adria capacity limits; outages; inland logistics; energy and carbon costs</description>
