Recent: Non-Russian processing increased, but diversification is constrained by Adria availability and refinery adaptation — a 2025 Arab Light delivery shortfall exposed the limits
Strategic role: Slovakia&apos;s only refinery and one of Central Europe&apos;s most complex refining-petrochemical sites
