Recent: April 2024 — INEOS acquired TotalEnergies&apos; adjacent Lavéra petrochemical assets (Naphtachimie cracker, Appryl PP, Gexaro aromatics, naphtha storage). Since Grangemouth stopped refining (April 2025), Lavéra is Petroineos&apos; principal crude refinery
Strategic role: The largest refinery in southern France and one of southern Europe&apos;s largest sites — fuels, jet, bunkers and bitumen
