Recent: ~3 Mt of products in FY2024/25 plus ~1.1 Mt of feedstocks to other Egyptian companies; &gt;EGP 2bn of 2025 projects incl. a 5,000 m³/h hydrogen-unit restart and ~100,000 t/yr more gasoline
Strategic role: Part of the Alexandria refining cluster — fuels plus higher-value lubricants, waxes and aromatics
