				<Placemark>
					<name>Ecomar Energy Solutions Refinery</name>
					<description>Status: Operational; expansion programme in development
Owner/Operator: Ecomar Energy Solutions FZC
Role: Modular crude-processing and petroleum-regeneration refinery with integrated product storage and marine/truck handling
Current capacity: Approximately 20,000 b/d refining and 100,000 m³ storage
Planned capacity: Up to 60,000 b/d refining and more than 800,000 m³ storage
Products: Naphtha, kerosene, gasoil and fuel oil
Strategic role: Adds flexible local conversion capacity to a hub otherwise dominated by storage, blending and bunker distribution
Risks: Expansion execution; smaller scale than the principal Fujairah refining complex; dependence on imported feedstock and port access</description>
