					<description>Status: Operational
Owner: Brunei Shell Petroleum — Shell 50%, Government of Brunei 50%
Capacity: 8,600 b/d — a small topping refinery, twenty times smaller than Hengyi
Feedstock: Local Brunei crude from the adjacent Seria field
Role: Supplied Brunei&apos;s domestic fuel needs for decades before Hengyi arrived; now a minor local plant
Risks: Very small scale; largely superseded for national fuel supply</description>
