					<description>Status: Operational
Owner/Operator: Fluxel
Role: Tanker reception and loading terminal within the Fos-sur-Mer petroleum zone (Grand Port Maritime de Marseille) — handles crude and refined/chemical products on separate berths, feeding onward storage and the SPSE pipeline toward Karlsruhe
Berths: Seven quay positions — three for crude, three for refined/chemical products, one mixed
Connectivity: Part of the wider Fos-sur-Mer hub alongside Dépôts Pétroliers de Fos and the SPSE crude terminal
