Role: The export point for Niger&apos;s Meleck crude — a single-point mooring offshore Sème/Cotonou, Benin, at the end of the 1,950 km pipeline; the first Suezmax cargo (Front Cascade, 1.1 million bbl) loaded here in May 2024
