					<description>Status: Operational
Owner/Operator: NNPC Ltd–Chevron Nigeria joint venture; operated by Chevron Nigeria Limited
Role: Offshore single-buoy mooring system used to load export crude into ocean-going tankers outside the shallow Escravos River approaches
Capacity: Two SBM berths; reported capability to receive tankers of up to approximately 286,000 DWT
