				<Placemark>
					<name>Monterrey Station (Casanare)</name>
					<description>Status: Operational
Owner/Operator: Cenit (Ecopetrol)
Role: The convergence point where Rubiales heavy crude (via the ODL pipeline) ties into OCENSA — Colombia&apos;s main export artery to Coveñas
Why it matters: Set up under Ecopetrol&apos;s national crude-evacuation programme as the Llanos basin&apos;s key distribution hub, gathering flows from Apiay (Castilla, Chichimene) as well as the ODL line from Rubiales, before the crude continues north on OCENSA
Risks: A single convergence point for multiple Llanos crude streams; capacity here has repeatedly needed expansion as new fields came online</description>
