			<Placemark>
				<name>Samotlor–Ust-Balyk Pipeline</name>
				<description>Status: Operational
Route: Samotlor / Nizhnevartovsk → Ust-Balyk (Nefteyugansk area); roughly 215 km
Owner/Operator: Transneft Siberia
Role: Closes the link between the Samotlor production area and the Ust-Balyk collection junction — the segment that lets both Samotlor crude and everything arriving from the Arctic via Purpe continue into the Ust-Balyk–Omsk trunk
Why it matters: Without this leg the Arctic chain dead-ends at Samotlor. With it, crude from Zapolyarnoye and Vankor can reach Omsk and from there either the European outlets or ESPO
Alignment: schematic — the connection is documented, the drawn corridor is indicative</description>
