			</Placemark>
			<Placemark>
				<name>Troll Oil Pipeline</name>
				<description>Status: Operational
Route: Troll B and Troll C platforms → Mongstad terminal; roughly 80 km
Owner/Operator: Equinor
Handles: Troll Blend — at ~0.13% sulfur the sweetest grade in the Dated Brent basket, added to BFOET in 2018
Connectivity: Lands at Mongstad, which also receives Johan Sverdrup, making that terminal the loading point for two very different grades — one ultra-sweet light, one medium sour
Strategic role: Carries the oil produced from Troll&apos;s thin oil rim beneath the gas cap, drained by long horizontal wells
Risks: Oil-rim depletion as gas production continues; shares Mongstad&apos;s terminal concentration</description>
				<styleUrl>#msn_ylw-pushpin</styleUrl>
				<LineString>
					<tessellate>1</tessellate>
					<coordinates>
						3.72,60.64,0 4.3,60.72,0 5.031,60.815,0 
