						57.52000000000001,22.38,0 56.71407996459693,21.34250836752022,0 57.45000000000001,20.6,0 57.65,19.8,0 
					</coordinates>
				</LineString>
			</Placemark>
			<Placemark>
				<name>Main Oil Line (MOL) — Interior to Mina al-Fahal</name>
				<description>Status: Operational
Route: The interior production clusters (Yibal, Fahud and the gathering network) → Adam → Izki → through the Sumail Gap in the Hajar mountains → Mina al-Fahal terminal, Muscat
Owner/Operator: Petroleum Development Oman
Capacity: Sized for PDO&apos;s full production — the single evacuation spine of Omani crude
Handles: The Oman Export Blend — the commingled stream of light, medium and heavy interior crudes that prices the DME Oman futures contract
Strategic role: The country&apos;s one artery — everything PDO produces crosses the mountains through this line to a coast that lies entirely outside the Strait of Hormuz
Risks: Single-trunkline concentration; mountain-crossing exposure; blend-quality management across dozens of input streams</description>
				<styleUrl>#msn_ylw-pushpin</styleUrl>
				<LineString>
					<tessellate>1</tessellate>
					<coordinates>
						56.03,22.19,0 56.48,22.35,0 57.52000000000001,22.38,0 57.77,22.93,0 58.02,23.31,0 58.5,23.63,0 
					</coordinates>
				</LineString>
			</Placemark>
			<Placemark>
				<name>Ras Markaz – Duqm Refinery Crude Pipeline</name>
				<description>Status: Operational
Route: Ras Markaz Crude Oil Park → ~80 km north along the coastal corridor → the OQ8 Duqm refinery&apos;s dedicated crude tanks (eight tanks at the refinery end); operational since April 2023
Owner/Operator: OTTCO / OQ8 system
Handles: The refinery&apos;s full crude diet — Kuwaiti and Omani grades landed at the SPM and stored at Ras Markaz, delivered on refinery demand
Strategic role: The line that makes Duqm work — an outside-the-strait refinery fed from an outside-the-strait terminal, the only link in its supply chain that touches no chokepoint at all
Risks: Single feed line for a 230,000 b/d plant; remote-corridor maintenance; upstream dependence on the tanker shuttle until the national grid connection exists</description>
				<styleUrl>#msn_ylw-pushpin</styleUrl>
				<LineString>
					<tessellate>1</tessellate>
					<coordinates>
