					<description>Status: Operational
Owner/Operator: MVP Terminalling LLC — operated by Magellan Midstream (now ONEOK), ~25% Magellan with a financial partner
Role: A refined-petroleum-products marine storage terminal on the Houston Ship Channel at Pasadena
Capacity: Over 5 million barrels of storage, two ship docks and truck-loading facilities, with room to nearly double
Function: Independent third-party products storage and distribution — gasoline, diesel and related refined products
Why here: Commercial rented storage, same category as BOSTCO and Vopak
Risks: Ship Channel congestion; refined-product demand cycles</description>
