				<Placemark id="0B121B0EA13FA002D0B3">
					<name>Paris region storage (Île-de-France pipeline network)</name>
					<description>Status: Operational
Role: Represents the roughly 25 regional fuel depots (each over 400 m³) fed by TRAPIL&apos;s Le Havre-Paris (LHP) pipeline network — Europe&apos;s largest refined-products pipeline system (1,375 km) — supplying the Paris conurbation and Roissy/Orly airports
Owner/Operator: Depots run by multiple oil companies and distributors; the LHP pipeline itself is operated by TRAPIL (majority-owned by Pisto SAS since 2019, with TotalEnergies retaining a minority stake)
Risks: This is a generalised regional marker rather than a single named facility; concentrates Paris-region fuel supply on one pipeline network</description>
