						<description>Status: Operational
Role: Germany&apos;s largest airport and Lufthansa&apos;s main hub — one of Europe&apos;s top long-haul and cargo airports
Fuel relevance: Supplied via the Mainz-Gustavsburg depot already on this map, fed by pipeline from the Rhine-Main network; also linked to the RMR products pipeline from the ARA refining hub
Connectivity: Sits at the centre of the same Rhine corridor as RMR, the NATO pipeline and Gustavsburg
Risks: Concentrated dependence on a small number of pipeline-fed depots for a very high daily fuel burn</description>
