						<description>Status: Operational
Role: The Netherlands&apos; main hub and Air France-KLM&apos;s principal base — one of Europe&apos;s busiest cargo and passenger airports
Fuel relevance: Draws directly on the ARA (Amsterdam-Rotterdam-Antwerp) refining and storage hub already on this map — one of the shortest crude-to-wingtip supply chains of any major airport
Connectivity: Vopak and other Amsterdam-area storage terminals feed the airport by pipeline
Risks: Dutch aviation-tax and capacity-cap policy debates affecting long-term throughput</description>
