						<description>Status: Operational
Role: France&apos;s largest airport and Air France&apos;s main hub — one of the world&apos;s ten busiest airports
Fuel relevance: Supplied via the TRAPIL Le Havre-Paris (LHP) pipeline network already on this map, built in part to serve Roissy/CDG and Orly
Connectivity: Directly tied to the Paris-region storage depots and Le Havre tank farms already mapped
