						<description>Status: Operational
Role: Singapore&apos;s flagship hub and one of the world&apos;s busiest long-haul and transfer airports
Fuel relevance: Directly served by the Singapore/Jurong Island refining and storage complex and the Singapore Pricing Hub (MOPS) already on this map — one of the tightest refinery-to-airport links in Asia
Connectivity: Jurong Island refineries and bunkering terminals feed the airport
Risks: Concentrated dependence on Singapore&apos;s own refining and storage capacity</description>
