					<Placemark>
						<name>Dubai International Airport</name>
						<description>Status: Operational
Role: The world&apos;s busiest airport by international passenger traffic; Emirates&apos; hub and a global long-haul transfer point
Fuel relevance: Directly tied to the Fujairah bunkering and storage cluster already on this map, one of the world&apos;s largest bunker-fuel hubs
Connectivity: Fed by pipeline and truck from Jebel Ali and Fujairah-area storage terminals
Risks: Regional Gulf tension affecting shipping and supply routes into the Emirates</description>
						<styleUrl>#msn_icon?color=1976d2&amp;id=2000&amp;scale=440001</styleUrl>
