					<Placemark>
						<name>Airport Beauvais Paris</name>
						<description>Status: Operational
Role: A secondary, low-cost-carrier airport serving the greater Paris region
Fuel relevance: Minor by volume compared with CDG/Orly; included here for regional completeness rather than global market weight
Risks: Limited strategic significance to the physical oil market at a global scale</description>
