						<name>Brussels Airport</name>
						<description>Status: Operational
Role: Belgium&apos;s main hub, serving Brussels Airlines and a range of European carriers
Fuel relevance: Draws on the same ARA-region refining and storage infrastructure as Antwerp and Rotterdam, already extensively mapped
Risks: A mid-sized European hub rather than a global demand driver</description>
