						<description>Status: Operational
Role: Switzerland&apos;s largest airport and Swiss International Air Lines&apos; hub
Fuel relevance: Supplied via Swiss inland distribution, drawing on the same Rhine-fed Basel/Muttenz tank farms already mapped, plus the Cressier refinery
Risks: Landlocked supply chain fully dependent on the Rhine barge and rail logistics documented elsewhere on this map</description>
