					<Placemark>
						<name>Cologne airport</name>
						<description>Status: Operational
Role: A secondary German hub, notably a major European air-freight (cargo) airport
Fuel relevance: Supplied via the Rhine-Ruhr pipeline network (NWO/RMR) already mapped
Risks: Regional rather than globally significant demand volume</description>
