						<name>Dusseldorf airport</name>
						<description>Status: Operational
Role: A major regional German airport serving North Rhine-Westphalia
Fuel relevance: Same Rhine-Ruhr supply network as Cologne and the Gelsenkirchen-area terminals already mapped
