					<Placemark>
						<name>Geneva airport</name>
						<description>Status: Operational
Role: Switzerland&apos;s second-largest airport, serving the Lake Geneva region
Fuel relevance: Directly fed by the Vernier tank farm cluster already mapped in detail — one of the most direct links between a mapped storage site and an airport on this map
Risks: Same Seveso-site and single-pipeline risks already documented for the Vernier depot</description>
