					<Placemark>
						<name>Muscat airport</name>
						<description>Status: Operational
Role: Oman&apos;s main international gateway
Fuel relevance: Supplied domestically from Omani refining capacity (Mina al-Fahal, Sohar, Duqm) already mapped
Risks: Regional significance rather than a top-tier global demand node</description>
