					<Placemark>
						<name>Airport of Strasbourg</name>
						<description>Status: Operational
Role: Regional airport serving Strasbourg and the Alsace region (Strasbourg-Entzheim), with scheduled domestic and European routes and Air France regional connections
Fuel relevance: A very minor demand node globally — likely supplied by truck from the Strasbourg oil terminal depot already on this map, rather than by dedicated pipeline
Risks: Negligible strategic significance to global jet-fuel markets; included here for regional completeness rather than market weight</description>
